{"title":"Checking the AI audit of Saez and Zucman’s research.","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/972753755/0/marginalrevolution~Checking-the-AI-audit-of-Saez-and-Zucman%e2%80%99s-research.html","date":1794310334000,"content":"<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/mrsaneapps/status/2119844582225489947?s=46\" target=\"_blank\">From SaneCite</a>:</p>\r\n<blockquote><p>We checked the anonymous AI audit of Emmanuel Saez and Gabriel Zucman’s research that Marginal Revolution featured on 28 Oct: all 147 problems it calls serious enough to change a headline number, against the papers, their sources and the authors’ own data. The audit’s facts hold up: for 131 of the 147, every fact we could check was right, and none had its core facts wrong. 21 of the 147 change a headline number; 98 depend on a disputed choice of method; 20 change no number; 8 we could not check on that question. A second pass graded the 99 flags we first counted as depending on a disputed choice of method: 11 standard, 70 defensible, 11 questionable, 6 we could not grade, and 1 contested. It found one, No. 54, that does change a headline number, which is why the counts are now 21 and 98. Saez and Zucman were sent our findings on 29 Oct and did not reply by 6 Nov.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://sanecite.com/saez-zucman-check\" target=\"_blank\">the audit of the audit</a>, open code and data, kudos to the authors.  Here was <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/10/errors-in-the-research-of-emmanuel-saez-and-gabriel-zucman.html\" target=\"_blank\">the original AI audit</a>.  Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://saez-zucman-audit-replication.vercel.app/\" target=\"_blank\">the October 30 revision of that audit</a>.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Addendum</strong>: And <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://sanecite.com/saez-zucman-check\" target=\"_blank\">a revised version with less jargon</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/11/checking-the-ai-audit-of-saez-and-zucmans-research.html\">Checking the AI audit of Saez and Zucman’s research.</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/972753755/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/972753755/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/972753755/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/972753755/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/972753755/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/972753755/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/11/checking-the-ai-audit-of-saez-and-zucmans-research.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/11/checking-the-ai-audit-of-saez-and-zucmans-research.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/11/checking-the-ai-audit-of-saez-and-zucmans-research.html#comment